# Cloudflare Workers 靜態資產安全標頭（S3）
# 之前這裡完全沒有檔案，站台因此沒有送出任何 CSP／HSTS／nosniff／frame 限制。
#
# CSP 已強制。POS 仍可連到店內可設定的 HTTP/HTTPS LINE Pay／列印服務；
# script、frame、object、base 與 form 來源則維持明確白名單。
# 未配置 CSP 回報端點，因此不另送只會產生瀏覽器 Console 警告的 Report-Only 標頭。

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'self' https://*.line.me; frame-ancestors 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://unpkg.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://static.line-scdn.net https://www.gstatic.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://apis.google.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; media-src 'self' data: blob: https:; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.line.me https://*.firebaseapp.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://*.firebasedatabase.app wss://*.firebasedatabase.app wss://*.firebaseio.com https://*.googleapis.com https://www.gstatic.com https://pb.yuangi168.com wss://pb.yuangi168.com https://secure-order.yuangi168.com https://linepay.yuangi168.com https://api.openai.com https://api.line.me https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.cloudflareinsights.com http://127.0.0.1:* http://localhost:*

# 全站不得被 iframe 嵌入（LIFF 走 in-app 瀏覽器，不受影響）。
# 麥克風只有 POS 語音點餐需要。
/pos*
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=(), microphone=(self)
